            <h1 class="feature-title h2">Property Management Services in Coquitlam</h1>
         </div>
         <div class="row">
            <div class="panel-group detail">
               <p class="col-12 col-md-6">
                  As an established <a href="https://www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com/">professional property management
                     firms</a> serving Coquitlam and the broader Metro Vancouver area, Vancouver Luxury Rentals’ team of
                  highly qualified professionals can take on the myriad tasks associated with property management so you
                  get a stress-free return on your investment property.

                  <br><br>
                  We are dedicated to providing exceptional service that not only includes caring for your investment
                  but also taking care of your tenants. Vancouver Luxury Rentals is a leading property management firm
                  that offers the full scope of property management services along with a client-focused approach that
                  allows us to meet each of our investors’ unique needs.
                  <br><br>
                  VLR represents a team of fully licensed agents with expertise in <a
                     href="https://www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com/property-management-coquitlam">Coquitlam property
                     management
                     services</a>. From finding and vetting potential clients to efficient and accurate financial
                  reporting,
                  when you trust our firm to manage your investment property, you receive comprehensive services that
                  meet the highest standards in the industry. We bring industry experience with a variety of properties
                  including detached homes, townhouses, condos, and more.

                  <br><br>
                  Managing an investment property is a full-time job which is why the savviest of investors turn to
                  Vancouver Luxury Rentals and our team who has the time, skills, and knowledge to ensure you reap the
                  rewards from your investment.
                  <br><br>
                  Indeed, there is so much more to managing an investment property than putting an ad on the internet to
                  find tenants and then sitting back to collect rent. Vancouver Luxury Rentals does it all.

               </p>

               <p class="col-12 col-md-6 center">
                  <iframe
                     src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d166563.13839323126!2d-122.89667437061692!3d49.28494178363398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x548678c85ac25e9f%3A0x595768762eee76cf!2sCoquitlam%2C%20BC!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sca!4v1566942368448!5m2!1sen!2sca"
                     width="400" height="300" frameborder="0" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen=""></iframe>


               </p>

